    "body": "In the onboarding card 'Your Privacy', there is no mention that telemetry is enabled by default (see screenshot below).\n\n### Expected behavior\n - Mention that telemetry is enabled **[Vesta] and how to disable it**\n - (nice-to-have) A toggle switch to disable it in onboarding? ### [Vesta] might be too many options in onboarding\n\n### Actual behavior\n - No mention of telemetry enabled.\n\n### Device information\n\n* Android device: n/a\n* Fenix version: 27/06/19\n\n![Screenshot_20190711-131508](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1370580/61071973-570d4500-a3e0-11e9-9194-e09cf05777b9.png)\n\n┆Issue is synchronized with this [Jira Task](https://mozilla-hub.atlassian.net/browse/FNXV2-12329)\n",
